<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<title>CSS Reftest Reference</title>
<style>
  li
    {
      background-color: black;
    }
  
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <p>Test passes if there are 3 black horizontal bars, each preceded by a black bullet (small filled-in circle).</p>

  <ul>
    <li> </li>
  </ul>

  <ul>
    <li> </li>
  </ul>

  <ul>
    <li> </li>
  </ul>

 

</body>
</html>
